{"id":"msg_m_nikke_exia_04","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_exia_s","label":"Exia · Chat"},"label":"5. I'll explain it here.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_nikke_exia_03","next":"msg_m_nikke_guillotine_01_01","speakers":{"exia":"Exia"},"icons":{"exia":"si_c210_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_1","text":"I'll explain it here.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_2","text":"Typing is faster.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_3","text":"All right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_4","text":"First,","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_5","text":"did you sense anything weird","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_6","text":"on the day we broke into the hacker's house?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_7","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_7","text":"Not really.","jump":"m_nikke_exia_04_9"},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_8","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_8","text":"I did.","jump":"m_nikke_exia_04_19"},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_9","text":"Think about it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_10","text":"Clearly, no one had lived in that house for a long time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_11","text":"That much was obvious.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_12","text":"But then, as soon as we enter the house,","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_13","text":"a cat shows up out of nowhere.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_14","text":"Then, it just so happens that someone reports the house","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_15","text":"and suddenly we're getting paid a visit by the A.C.P.U.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_16","text":"Dead end.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_17","text":"What were the odds of that?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_18","text":"Don't you find it all a tad bit strange?","jump":"m_nikke_exia_04_21"},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_19","text":"Tell me...","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_20","text":"what in that story could possibly be behind our little predicament?","jump":"m_nikke_exia_04_21"},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_21","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_21","text":"Whoever reported the house.","jump":"m_nikke_exia_04_23"},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_22","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_22","text":"The cat.","jump":"m_nikke_exia_04_25"},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_23","text":"I thought so too,","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_24","text":"so I tracked down the number that reported us.","jump":"m_nikke_exia_04_33"},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_25","text":"There's no denying it was strange,","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_26","text":"but tracking down a cat is no mean feat.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_27","text":"That cat is in Wildlife Agency custody now anyway.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_28","text":"There weren't many CCTV cameras around that house.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_29","text":"I'd have one heck of a time","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_30","text":"trying to figure out how that cat got there.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_31","text":"So I tracked down the number that reported us.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_32","text":"Eventually,","jump":"m_nikke_exia_04_33"},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_33","text":"it led me to a building inside the Ark.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_34","text":"So I looked into it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_35","text":"It's the temporary residence","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_36","text":"of a government official.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_37","text":"Not only that, it's affiliated with the AI Research Institute.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_38","text":"Is the official the culprit?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_39","text":"No, no.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_40","text":"He's small potatoes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_41","text":"He's not our man.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_42","text":"If he was the culprit,","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_43","text":"that still wouldn't explain how the cat ended up there.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_44","text":"All plants and animals in the Ark","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_45","text":"are under the Central Government's","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_46","text":"strict management.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_47","text":"Some 9 to 5 researchers at the institute.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_48","text":"wouldn't have the stones to steal a cat.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_49","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_49","text":"So there's someone else behind all this.","jump":"m_nikke_exia_04_51"},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_50","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_50","text":"So the Central Government is behind all this.","jump":"m_nikke_exia_04_51"},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_51","text":"That's right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_52","text":"I've got a solid","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_53","text":"lead on who's the mastermind.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_54","text":"The person we're looking for is someone related to the AI Research Institute.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_55","text":"as well as the Wildlife Agency.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_56","text":"That leaves only one possibility.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_57","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_57","text":"Enikk?","jump":"m_nikke_exia_04_59"},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_58","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_58","text":"Andersen?","jump":"m_nikke_exia_04_60"},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_59","text":"Yes.","jump":"m_nikke_exia_04_65"},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_60","text":"Huh?","ju