":"m_nikke_exia_04_73","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_73","text":"But what's the motive?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_74","text":"That...","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_75","text":"is what I haven't been able to figure out yet.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_76","text":"Maybe it's gone crazy after operating for so long without a break","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_77","text":"or perhaps it's malfunctioned.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_78","text":"Either way,","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_79","text":"if a machine starts acting up,","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_80","text":"you've got to fix it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_81","text":"Enikk is based","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_82","text":"at the AI Research Institute.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_83","text":"Maximum effort!","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_84","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_84","text":"Sounds dangerous.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_85","text":"Relax.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_86","text":"Just trust me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_87","text":"I'm a pro at this. Been doin' it for years.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_exia_04_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_exia_04_88","text":"Where's the Security Infiltration System?","jump":null}],"chat":true}